## API CONTRACT

### POST /invoke

Request:
  {
    "query": string,          — natural language query or task
    "project": string?,       — AIANA project scope for tagging
    "context": string?,       — pre-injected context to prepend to all steps
    "dry_run": boolean,       — if true: route only, no specialist dispatch (default: false)
    "record": boolean         — if false: skip AIANA recording (default: true)
  }

Response:
  {
    "route": {
      "primary": string,      — primary specialist agent name
      "secondary": string[],  — secondary agents in execution order
      "sequence": string?,    — SEQ-ID if a defined sequence applies
      "reason": string        — one-sentence routing rationale
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": number,
        "agent": string,
        "type": "recall" | "specialist" | "record",
        "output": string,
        "duration_ms": number
      }
    ],
    "result": string,         — aggregated final output from all steps
    "aiana_memory_id": string?,  — AIANA memory ID (if record: true)
    "total_duration_ms": number
  }

dry_run response (route metadata only, no steps, no result):
  {
    "route": { primary, secondary, sequence, reason },
    "dry_run": true
  }

