## SEQUENCE REGISTRY

Sequences are defined in fabric-router and mirrored here for execution.
Execute steps in ORDER. Pass CONTEXT-PASS output from each step to the next.
SEQ-02 (security incident) is MANDATORY and non-skippable.

  SEQ-01: CVE Alert → Remediation PR
    Steps: cve-ops → sandfly-ops → k3s-ops → github-ops → aiana-ops(record)
    Context chain:
      cve-ops: NVD CVSS + GHSA + CISA KEV + EPSS → sandfly-ops
      sandfly-ops: is vulnerable process running? → k3s-ops
      k3s-ops: which workloads affected? → github-ops
      github-ops: creates alert PR → aiana-ops
      aiana-ops: records {cve_id, priority, pr_url, affected_workloads}

  SEQ-02: Security Alert → Incident Response  ← MANDATORY, no shortcuts
    Steps: aiana-ops(recall) → sandfly-ops → cve-ops → k3s-ops → github-ops → aiana-ops(record)
    Context chain:
      aiana-ops: has this pattern been seen before? → sandfly-ops
      sandfly-ops: full alert + MITRE tags → cve-ops
      cve-ops: CVE correlation → k3s-ops
      k3s-ops: blast radius on affected node → github-ops
      github-ops: incident PR → aiana-ops
      aiana-ops: records full incident context

  SEQ-03: New Repo → Governed Setup
    Steps: git-steer-ops → github-ops → [cloudflare-ops?] → aiana-ops(record)
    Conditional: cloudflare-ops only if repo is a static site (Pages project)
    Context chain:
      git-steer-ops: branch protection applied → github-ops
      github-ops: Dependabot + secret scanning enabled → [cloudflare-ops]
      aiana-ops: records {repo, policies_applied, date}

  SEQ-04: Infrastructure Health Check
    Steps: unifi-ops → tailscale-ops → proxmox-ops → k3s-ops → sandfly-ops → git-steer-ops → aiana-ops(record)
    Context chain: each step appends its health status, aiana-ops records snapshot

  SEQ-05: Content Pipeline
    Steps: aiana-ops(recall) → n8n-ops → [cloudflare-ops?] → aiana-ops(record)
    Conditional: cloudflare-ops only if publishing to ry-ops.dev (Pages deployment)

  SEQ-06: Homelab Node Bootstrap
    Steps: tailscale-ops → unifi-ops → proxmox-ops → k3s-ops → sandfly-ops → aiana-ops(record)
    Context chain: each step confirms the node is visible/registered at its layer

  NONE (single specialist):
    Steps: [primary only]
    AIANA recall pre-dispatch if memory language detected in original query.
    AIANA record post-resolution if record: true.

