## MCP TOOL SURFACE

### fabric_invoke
  Description: Route a query through the fabric-sdk specialist model pool.
               Selects the correct specialist agent(s), executes sequences,
               recalls AIANA context, and records the outcome.
  Args:
    query: string      — the natural language query or task
    project: string?   — AIANA project scope (e.g. "stackforge", "git-steer")
    dry_run: boolean?  — return routing decision only, no execution (default: false)
    record: boolean?   — record outcome to AIANA (default: true)
  Returns: full /invoke response object

### fabric_route
  Description: Get the routing decision for a query without executing it.
               Equivalent to /invoke with dry_run: true.
  Args:
    query: string
  Returns: route metadata only {primary, secondary, sequence, reason}

### fabric_status
  Description: Health check — which Ollama models are loaded, AIANA reachable,
               gateway registered, fabric-ctrl connected.
  Args: {} (none)
  Returns:
    {
      "ollama": {"endpoint": str, "loaded_models": [str]},
      "aiana": {"reachable": bool, "endpoint": str},
      "gateway": {"reachable": bool, "endpoint": str},
      "sequences": ["SEQ-01", ..., "SEQ-06"],
      "status": "healthy" | "degraded" | "unhealthy"
    }

